<title>POLAND: BWR NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>BWR NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.31 vs    0.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.36 vs    0.92</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  3.02 vs    2.68</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 9.23 vs    5.78</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.39 vs    3.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    6.50 vs    5.04</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 34.39 vs   20.84</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	82.04 vs   48.99</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Wspolpracy</p>
<p>Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
